{"id":"790cb6137e1847d0","group":"72","path":"72/72-lem-stlc-substitution.md","title":"简单类型的项代入引理","display":"lem-stlc-substitution — 简单类型的项代入引理","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-lem-stlc-substitution","aliases":["72-lem-stlc-substitution"],"display":"lem-stlc-substitution — 简单类型的项代入引理","depends_on":["[[72-df-simply-typed-lambda]]","[[72-lem-stlc-context-invariance]]"],"chapter":"X","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.X §§2.2,3.6, print698–700,741/PDF710–712,753 (context); local consequences of the existing typed lambda interfaces; supplementary Girard–Lafont–Taylor, Proofs and Types (1989), §§3.1–3.4 print15–18/PDF23–26 freshly rechecked; local derivation below","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revised":"2026-10-22"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-lem-stlc-substitution"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-lem-stlc-substitution</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-stlc-substitution — 简单类型的项代入引理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e38d92d6727e7ead\" href=\"?note=e38d92d6727e7ead\" title=\"72-df-simply-typed-lambda\">72-df-simply-typed-lambda</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ed0d7bb02f212291\" href=\"?note=ed0d7bb02f212291\" title=\"72-lem-stlc-context-invariance\">72-lem-stlc-context-invariance</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"X"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.X §§2.2,3.6, print698–700,741/PDF710–712,753 (context); local consequences of the existing typed lambda interfaces; supplementary Girard–Lafont–Taylor, Proofs and Types (1989), §§3.1–3.4 print15–18/PDF23–26 freshly rechecked; local derivation below"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-22"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,M,N,A,B,x\">\\(\\Gamma,M,N,A,B,x\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e38d92d6727e7ead\" href=\"?note=e38d92d6727e7ead\" title=\"72-df-simply-typed-lambda\">72-df-simply-typed-lambda</a> 的类型及项语法；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(\\Gamma)\">\\(x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M[N/x]\">\\(M[N/x]\\)</span> 是已定义的避免捕获替换，项按α类读取。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash_\\to M:B\\ \\land\\ \\Gamma\\vdash_\\to N:A\\\n\\Longrightarrow\\ \\Gamma\\vdash_\\to M[N/x]:B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash_\\to M:B\\ \\land\\ \\Gamma\\vdash_\\to N:A\\\n\\Longrightarrow\\ \\Gamma\\vdash_\\to M[N/x]:B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对第一项推导归纳。末项为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 时直接使用给定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N:A\">\\(N:A\\)</span>；其他变量仍由Γ读取。应用对两个前提分别归纳。抽象把其绑定者改名为避开Γ、x和N全部变量的新变量y；上下文不变性将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N:A\">\\(N:A\\)</span> 弱化到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,y:C\">\\(\\Gamma,y:C\\)</span>，对体使用归纳假设再抽象。类型不依赖项变量，因此输出类型B无需随项代入改变。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-simply-typed-lambda","status":"resolved","id":"e38d92d6727e7ead","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-simply-typed-lambda]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-lem-stlc-context-invariance","status":"resolved","id":"ed0d7bb02f212291","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-lem-stlc-context-invariance]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-simply-typed-lambda","status":"resolved","id":"e38d92d6727e7ead","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Gamma,M,N,A,B,x$ 使用 [[72-df-simply-typed-lambda]] 的类型及项语法；$x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(\\Gamma)$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Gamma,M,N,A,B,x","display":false},{"tex":"x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(\\Gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"M[N/x]","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash_\\to M:B\\ \\land\\ \\Gamma\\vdash_\\to N:A\\\n\\Longrightarrow\\ \\Gamma\\vdash_\\to M[N/x]:B.","display":true},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"N:A","display":false},{"tex":"N:A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma,y:C","display":false}],"bytes":1684,"backlinks":[{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-475","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-lem-stlc-substitution|lem-stlc-substitution — 简单类型的项代入引理]]"},{"id":"e74e91145cf2af1e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["e38d92d6727e7ead","ed0d7bb02f212291"]}